    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "IT IS HEREBY ORDERED THAT:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. The ASl Order is discharged with immediate effect.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Defendant's Set Aside Application is granted.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. The Claimant shall pay the Defendant its costs of the Set Aside Application on the standard basis.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The Defendant shall submit a Statement of Costs not exceeding three pages within 5 days of this",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Order.",
      "bbox": null,
