      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Assistant Registrar",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Date of issue: 19 December 2025",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "At: 9am",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Introduction",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. This is an Order following the Return Date hearing in the proceedings concerning the continuation",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "of the ASl Order dated 12 September 2025. The Defendant's Set Aside Application shall also be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "considered in light of its relevance to this Order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The issue for determination is whether, in light of the procedural developments that have occurred",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "since the ASl Order was issued, it is appropriate and necessary to continue the ASl Order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. For the reasons set out below, the ASl Order is dismissed.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Background",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The background and the parties' submissions are summarised only to the extent necessary for the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "determination of the Applications. Any omission of any fact, submission, or argument should not be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "taken as an indication that it was overlooked but merely reflects my focus on the matters material to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "my determination of these Applications.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. The Claimant sought ASl relief under Part 25 of the Rules of the DIFC Courts to restrain the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Defendant from pursuing proceedings in the Dubai onshore courts in relation to a commercial dispute.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "6. The parties' underlying dispute arises from trading terms dated 17 January 2025, which contains an",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "arbitration clause providing for arbitration under the rules of DlAC with the DIFC as the seat.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "7. On 12 September 2025 an ASl Order was issued and that order was intended to preserve the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "position pending inter partes consideration at the Return Date hearing.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "8. By the time of the Return Date hearing, the onshore Dubai court proceedings that prompted the ASl",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Order were no longer being pursued, and steps had been taken to advance the dispute through",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "arbitration.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "The Claimant's submissions",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "9. The Claimant submitted that the ASl Order should be continued and made final. It argued that there",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "is a binding arbitration agreement, that the Defendant breached that agreement by commencing",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "proceedings in the Dubai courts, and that discontinuance of those proceedings does not undo the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "breach.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "10. The Claimant further submitted that there remains a real risk of future proceedings being",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "commenced outside the agreed arbitral forum in the absence of a continuing injunction, and that final",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "anti-suit relief is required to protect the parties' bargain and the integrity of the arbitration agreement.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "The Defendant's submissions",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "11. The Defendant submitted that there is no longer any basis for continuing injunctive relief. It",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "emphasised that the Dubai Court proceedings had been withdrawn and that there are no foreign",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "proceedings presently which require restraint.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "12. The Defendant further submitted that the dispute is now proceeding in the agreed arbitral forum",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "and that, in those circumstances, the interim order has no further practical function.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "13. The Defendant argued that any asserted risk of future proceedings was speculative and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "insufficient to justify the continuation of coercive relief, particularly where the relief would operate only",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "in a preventative or punitive manner.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Discussion",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "14. The Court approaches applications for anti-suit relief with caution. Such relief is discretionary and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "must be directed to a real and present need to restrain conduct that undermines the agreed dispute",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "resolution mechanism.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "15. The interim anti-suit injunction in this case was granted to preserve the position pending inter",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "partes consideration. The question at the Return Date is whether there remains sufficient justification,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "in terms of necessity and proportionality, to maintain or extend that relief.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "16. The Court accepts that, at the time of the hearing, the onshore Dubai Court proceedings that gave",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "rise to the interim order were no longer being pursued. There was no evidence before me of any",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "existing foreign proceedings requiring restraint.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "17. The Court also took into account that the parties' dispute is now being progressed through",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "arbitration in accordance with the dispute resolution clause relied upon by the Claimant.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "18. In those circumstances, I am not satisfied that continuing injunctive relief would serve a useful or",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "proportionate purpose. The absence of any live proceedings means that the interim order has no",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p3-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "further practical function.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "19. While the Claimant expressed concern about the possibility of future proceedings, I am not",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "persuaded that such concern justifies the continuation of an injunction where the conduct complained",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "of has ceased and the agreed arbitral mechanism is now engaged.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "20. The appropriate course, in the exercise of my discretion, is therefore to refuse final anti-suit relief",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "and to discharge the ASl Order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "21. For the reasons set out above, the ASl Order is dismissed. The Defendant's Set Aside Application",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "58eae81bf668e7f6c58619f419a49b5e35e2e5c9c7475475ace28ec562580545-p4-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "is granted.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
